            </a>
            <a href="tel:+4974357519700" class="border border-white/20 text-white font-medium px-8 py-4 rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2">
              <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-5 h-5" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-8.63-3.07 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6 19.79 19.79 0 0 1-3.07-8.67A2 2 0 0 1 4.11 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.72c.127.96.361 1.903.7 2.81a2 2 0 0 1-.45 2.11L8.09 9.91a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 0 1 2.11-.45c.907.339 1.85.573 2.81.7A2 2 0 0 1 22 16.92z"/></svg>
              +49 7435 7519 700
            </a>
          </div>

          <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-2 text-sm text-gray-400">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Pioniere im Modulbau seit 2016</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Award 2026 EU Business News</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Föhn-stabile HVAC für GMP / BSL-3</div>
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="w-4 h-4 text-primary" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Wesemann-Gruppe · 60+ Jahre Laborbau</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <AuthorBio city="München" />


    <!-- PATTERN-INTERRUPT -->
    <section class="py-16 md:py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary/5 via-white to-primary/10 border-y border-primary/20">
      <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
        <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
          <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center mb-10">
            <div>
              <div class="text-primary font-bold text-sm uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">Pattern-Interrupt · Weltpremiere analytica 2026 München</div>
              <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-heading font-bold mb-4 text-slate-900">Auf der analytica in München zeigen wir, was ein Laborcontainer 2026 wirklich kann</h2>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Ein gewöhnlicher Laborcontainer hat 2.400 mm Innenhöhe. Sie passen rein – aufrecht arbeiten unter einem Abzug aber kaum.
              </p>
              <p class="text-lg text-slate-900 font-bold leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Der LABtoGO von Planexus hat 2.750 mm Innenhöhe. 9,5 m Außenlänge. 3 m Außenbreite. Vollverglaste Front, die echtes Tageslicht in jedes Münchner Klinik-, Forschungs- oder Pharmalabor bringt.
              </p>
              <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
                <strong>Ein gewöhnlicher Laborcontainer passt komplett in einen LABtoGO hinein.</strong> Wir nennen ihn nicht ohne Grund LABtoGO – er ist die Plattform, auf der wir für München BSL-2, BSL-3, GMP-Reinraum, Föhn-stabile HVAC und Vibrationsentkopplung VC-D konfigurieren.
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4">
              <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-1">2.750</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">mm Innenhöhe</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Standard: 2.400 mm</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-1">9.500</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">mm Außenlänge</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">3.000 mm Breite</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-1">100%</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">vollverglast</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Tageslicht-Labor</div>
              </div>
              <div class="bg-slate-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 text-center">
                <div class="text-4xl font-bold text-primary mb-1">U 0,20</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-wider">W/m²K Sandwich</div>
                <div class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">80–120 mm Dämmung</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="text-center">
            <a href="/laborcontainer/labtogo" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-primary font-bold hover:underline">
